To run
```
cd C:\Users\Jason\Downloads\arduino-cli_1.2.2_Windows_64bit
.\arduino-cli.exe compile -b arduino:avr:uno d:\Code\mycode\arduino\sketch1
.\arduino-cli.exe upload -t -p COM3 -b arduino:avr:uno d:\Code\mycode\arduino\sketch1
putty COM3 -serial -sercfg 9600,8,n,1,N
```


** Wiring Arduino Uno R3 **
1. Wire display according to display.cpp instructions.
2. Connect Arduino 3.3v to power strip plus and ground to ground strip.
3. Connect SENSEVAL-SCB4XV1 evaluation board
    1. Connect ground to pin 13
    2. Connect power strip to pin 1
    3. Connect Arduino SCL to pin 20
    3. Connect Arduino SDA to pin 21
    